# Incetro engineering

- Read the project instructions before the shared overlay. Project files win.
- Keep changes scoped to the requested behavior.
- Preserve user-owned files. Do not revert edits that Incetro does not own.
- Verify the change with the project's tests before calling it done.
- Prefer the existing ECC and project patterns over new abstractions.
